BT /F1 10.2 Tf 0.07 0.16 0.23 rg 1 0 0 1 50 625.0 Tm (object, transaction, free-space and recovery-related structures; the exact disk fields) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 0.07 0.16 0.23 rg 1 0 0 1 50 608.0 Tm (must be read from the matching source revision.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 0.07 0.16 0.23 rg 1 0 0 1 50 578.0 Tm (The persistent root and transaction state must be internally consistent before enabling) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 0.07 0.16 0.23 rg 1 0 0 1 50 561.0 Tm (writes. SFS is not FAT and does not use a FAT12-style next-cluster array for all files;) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 0.07 0.16 0.23 rg 1 0 0 1 50 544.0 Tm (similarly, it does not use the checksummed 24-byte OFS data block header. Object) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 0.07 0.16 0.23 rg 1 0 0 1 50 527.0 Tm (identifiers, free-space structures and transaction ordering are fundamental to) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 0.07 0.16 0.23 rg 1 0 0 1 50 510.0 Tm (understanding its recovery behaviour.) Tj ET
